  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate Protection; <strong>CL</strong> 5th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Cost</strong> 11,402 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 1&nbsp;lb.</p>\n<p>This poem has spread across many nations and is often memorized by schoolchildren as an element of their heritage. Magical transcriptions of the ballad of the lost hero allow the user to craft a banner of the saints a single time.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nEtch Schematic, Smith Magical Weapons And Armor, Craft Marvelous Item, Fate sphere (Align Object (word)), Protection sphere (Spell Ward (aegis, ward)); <strong>Cost</strong> 5,701 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/schematics#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
